src/session.rs is a port of desktop/src-tauri/src/native_relay_client.rs from
that project. Its connection policy — reconnect backoff, subscription
reconciliation, and CLOSED classification and recovery — is that module's
design, kept deliberately close to the original so the two do not drift.

This client also depends on buzz-core, buzz-sdk and buzz-ws-client from the
same project.
